                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1a6e9c6e-8d72-3385-84e2-08f30c6854cd",
                        "entry_id": "655373df-efff-3dcb-833f-501ad61211cd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "durch die Pest hervorgerufene, eiternde Schwellung des Hautgewebes"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8e31f079-c68e-4900-9d81-d0465a7cd71a",
                                "sense_id": "1a6e9c6e-8d72-3385-84e2-08f30c6854cd",
                                "text": "„Treten die Pesterreger – zum Beispiel beim inneren Aufbrechen von Pestbeulen oder auch durch äußere Verletzungen – in die Blutbahn ein, kommt es zu einer Pest-Sepsis.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "790d4eb0-5114-4af2-a595-f774647cc8f8",
                                "sense_id": "1a6e9c6e-8d72-3385-84e2-08f30c6854cd",
                                "text": "„Die Peſt, dieſes boͤsartige, oft epidemiſche, mit brennender Hitze, Schwindel, Durſt, und ausbrechenden Peſtbeulen begleitete hitzige Fieber, begleitet ein electriſcher Ueberfluß.“ [1785]"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "527c2be5-3565-3f57-bd26-477f3cdd325b",
                        "entry_id": "655373df-efff-3dcb-833f-501ad61211cd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "etwas oder jemand, gegen das/den man eine tiefe Abneigung empfindet"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "derogatory"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "30be56f9-d463-4e69-85ae-835fee6b80df",
                                "sense_id": "527c2be5-3565-3f57-bd26-477f3cdd325b",
                                "text": "„Wo Zensur, die Pestbeule staatlicher Gewalt, herrscht, versagt die Karikatur.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ae23b6b9-2fa4-409e-975f-316fcfca36de",
                        "source_entry_id": "655373df-efff-3dcb-833f-501ad61211cd",
                        "source_sense_id": "1a6e9c6e-8d72-3385-84e2-08f30c6854cd",
                        "source_sense_description": "durch die Pest hervorgerufene, eiternde Schwellung des Hautgewebes",
                        "target_lang_word": "plague spot",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "plague spot",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b9f9009b-d1b6-3166-bdb7-bec5d28a4170",
                                        "entry_id": "9c85ef8f-afec-31c5-acf0-3fc0ddfa9b42",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A spot on the skin that is characteristic of the plague or of a similar disease."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1fba67ad-876d-498f-916b-557edeb21fe8",
                                                "sense_id": "b9f9009b-d1b6-3166-bdb7-bec5d28a4170",
                                                "text": "But no plague-spot appeared, and when Steb woke up in the afternoon and demanded something to eat, it was pretty evicent that he was merely suffering from a feverish cold."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c8b9751-cf67-4ee9-952d-aab81b372efa",
                                                "sense_id": "b9f9009b-d1b6-3166-bdb7-bec5d28a4170",
                                                "text": "The first victim died 6 September after three days of illness when he developed swellings in the groin and neck and the fatal token, the plague spot."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "51042d50-1334-383e-b0c0-de5c7b4d83a3",
                                        "entry_id": "9c85ef8f-afec-31c5-acf0-3fc0ddfa9b42",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A location where plague is active."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "079e734f-38c9-4a44-9308-831a98a9a7d2",
                                                "sense_id": "51042d50-1334-383e-b0c0-de5c7b4d83a3",
                                                "text": "He notes that South Elmham deanery 'appears to have been a plague spot', but regrettably he supplies no reason for its unenviable condition."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe3cfe06-68ea-4c3f-8319-7b368d48c3d4",
                                                "sense_id": "51042d50-1334-383e-b0c0-de5c7b4d83a3",
                                                "text": "However, with the growth of young animals, the gerbils visit neighboring burrows and the plague spot therefore expands."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "73db0f7b-9c11-3303-adec-19ff8c51b957",
                                        "entry_id": "9c85ef8f-afec-31c5-acf0-3fc0ddfa9b42",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A location that is a plague or scourge; a place of corruption and degeneracy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9f708d0-9423-445d-b642-8b0d33ef8043",
                                                "sense_id": "73db0f7b-9c11-3303-adec-19ff8c51b957",
                                                "text": "Suffice it that all that is most worthless in Europe may be seen gathered round the gaming-tables at Monte Carlo. The artist who did these drawings has been there. Well, I thank Heaven we have no such plague-spot in this fair England of ours."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c479965-7550-490c-a2b8-65f29439ff81",
                                                "sense_id": "73db0f7b-9c11-3303-adec-19ff8c51b957",
                                                "text": "He turned the worst plague spot in Oxford, with its plague pit where lay 'filth, rotten corpses, and intestines of corpses', the dump of the refuse of the town, 'where thieves and malefactors used to lie in wait for opportunities of thieving, homicide, and other intolerable evils', into a splendid home for classical learning in which good Churchmen were to be trained."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c61027de-c5bb-405f-8723-ef581e979ffd",
                                                "sense_id": "73db0f7b-9c11-3303-adec-19ff8c51b957",
                                                "text": "He is the human hyena and moral leper who runs the scurrilous, venal, unspeakable rag around on Fifth Avenue, a creature whose base, degraded nature has made him a portable plague spot wherever he goes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
